Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||08-27-99||11:59 AM||||could someone send me a pic/illustration showing me the proper way to have the sparkplugs arrayed in my 86 SE-2m6? i used the chilton's manual, but cliff informed me that that book shows improper information. thanks much!
Z||000001||BENGAL4||08-27-99||01:11 PM||||Here is the firing order and spark plug set up.<p>                                     4         5        6<br>              <br>             5      6<br>         4                1<br>             3      2<br>                                    3          2        1<p>       <br>     4,5 &6 are on the firewall side and<br>     3,2 & 1 are on the trunk side.<p>How's that for primitive drawing. Good luck.                   
Z||000002||BENGAL4||08-27-99||01:13 PM||||Here is the firing order and spark plug set up.<p>                                     4.         5.        6.<br>              <br>             5.     6.<br>         4.                1.<br>             3.     2.<br>                                    3.          2.        1.<p>       <br>     4,5 &6 are on the firewall side and<br>     3,2 & 1 are on the trunk side.<p>How's that for primitive drawing. Good luck.                   
