Z||000004||FieroSTETZ||08-27-99||11:13 PM||||um... bengal, i tried re-setting them like that, ands now it doesn't even start, it just cranks and cranks... any ideas? see also my post "please someone be able to help me" for more background...
Z||000005||Cooter||08-29-99||12:27 AM||||I bought a v6 car and the timing was so low on it that it would do nothing but spin over. If you have the plug wires off by one spot on the distributer, that would cause the timing to be very high or very low, depending on which way you went wrong. If nothing else twist the distributer body counter clock-wise and see if it helps.
